      "qa": "Uses tú like the rest of the file. Asking a shop, café or hotel (the business), \"¿Tienen ___?\" (TYEH-nen, plural) is the most natural; usted form is \"¿Tiene ___?\". The blank takes an article only when English has one (wifi, comida vegetariana, but un cargador, un mapa), so the article goes with the word."
    },
    {
